/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 447 0 R
/E (Universiti Teknologi PETRONAS \(UTP\) was established on January 10, 1997, when PETRONAS was invited by the Malaysian Government to set up a university. The university was formerly known as The Institute of Technology PETRONAS \(ITP\) and was a wholly owned subsidiary of PETRONAS. UTP offers a wide range of industry-relevant engineering, science and technology programmes at undergraduate and postgraduate levels and aims to produce well-rounded graduates with excellent leadership qualities and communication abilities.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
